e0ec604eae916bb42964cf0.mp4?t=1773521507\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a fast-paced <strong>old-school FPS</strong> inspired by classic retro shooters\u2014focused on aggressive combat, movement, and resource management.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3356920/extras/d6b8e8054809b83850eca94eb1831c95.avif?t=1773521507\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3356920/extras_big/d6b8e8054809b83850eca94eb1831c95.webp?t=1773521507 width=1560 height=213 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26a1 <strong>Health-Powered Weapons</strong><br>Your guns are fueled by your life force. Every bullet drains your health, forcing you to balance aggression and survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddff <strong>Voodoo Magic Combat</strong><br>Use your Voodoo Staff to steal life from enemies, recover health, and unlock powerful abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc80 <strong>Fight the Undead</strong><br>Battle zombies and monstrous creatures lurking across a mysterious island filled with dark rituals and ancient secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfc3 <strong>Fast-Paced Retro FPS Action</strong><br>Designed with classic boomer shooter gameplay in mind\u2014quick movement, intense combat, and relentless enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa8 <strong>Stylized Comic-Inspired Visuals</strong><br>A bold art style that blends dark themes with graphic-novel energy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3356920/extras/f05d133c075fd6f9a38c3b45dc74814a.avif?t=1773521507\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3356920/extras_big/f05d133c075fd6f9a38c3b45dc74814a.webp?t=1773521507 width=1560 height=213 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3356920/extras/9b986450f398070dd8180524a0071527.poster.avif?t=1773521507\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3356920/extras/9b986450f398070dd8180524a0071527.webm?t=1773521507\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3356920/extras/9b986450f398070dd8180524a0071527.mp4?t=1773521507\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A remote island has fallen into chaos.<br>Dark forces are rising.<br>The dead walk again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Armed with powerful weapons and forbidden voodoo magic, you are the only one who can fight back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But every shot brings you closer to death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you master the power of the voodoo\u2026<br>or will the island consume your soul?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3356920/extras/4ab3b91670af19c4b9c7ccfabe3b3a8a.avif?t=1773521507\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3356920/extras_big/4ab3b91670af19c4b9c7ccfabe3b3a8a.webp?t=1773521507 width=1560 height=213 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight your way through\u00a0an island\u00a0 taken over by evil forces, with allies you'll meet along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Laverdure Kevin"],"